    <aside class="no-pressure"><p class="overline">COME AS YOU ARE. SPEND WHAT WORKS.</p><h3>Your company is the point.</h3><p>In theory, you could keep the weekend to the hotel and supermarket sandwiches: wander for free, use the included local transport and skip paid extras. The food figures above are allowances, not a minimum spend. The day trip is separate, as are getting to your UK airport and any personal travel costs.</p><p>We do not expect anyone to dig deep to join us on a sten do. There’s no expectation of fancy dinners, mountain lunches or keeping up with anyone else’s spending.</p><p>We’d love you there, but only if it works for you. We may still go as just the two of us, and that’s okay too. Please don’t stretch your budget for our weekend.</p></aside>
