  </section>

  <section class="section itinerary" aria-labelledby="weekend-title"><div><p class="overline">04 / A WEEKEND, NOT AN EXPEDITION</p><h2 id="weekend-title">Come for the people.<br /><em>Stay for Monday.</em></h2><p>We’re staying until Monday. Sunday departures are completely welcome. We’re planning the shared adventure for Saturday.</p></div><ol><li><span>FRI / 19</span><div><h3>Arrive. Unpack. Find dinner.</h3><p>Travel to Geneva, check into your chosen hotel and meet for a relaxed evening. Flight times to be agreed.</p></div></li><li><span>SAT / 20</span><div><h3>A day in the Alps.</h3><p>Our planned day for the shared excursion. We’ll arrange a suitable Saturday tour and share the itinerary.</p></div></li><li><span>SUN / 21</span><div><h3>One more coffee, or one more night.</h3><p>Geneva time and Sunday flights home, or stay with us for another relaxed evening.</p></div></li><li><span>MON / 22</span><div><h3>The leisurely goodbye.</h3><p>Breakfast, a little more Geneva if flight times allow, then home. Katie & Alex will be in this camp.</p></div></li></ol></section>

  <section class="section practical"><p class="overline">THE USEFUL SMALL PRINT</p><h2>A proposal with the sums showing.</h2><details><summary>What is confirmed, and what still needs checking?</summary><p>Hotel Rotary’s public room prices were observed on {CHECKED} for one room and two adults: £371.38 for 19–21 March and £553.65 for 19–22 March 2027. This does not confirm availability of six rooms at that rate. ibis budget Genève Aéroport showed £157.18 for two nights or £226.53 for three, including taxes, for a double room with an unused upper bunk. Only five rooms were shown at the three-night promotional rate, so six-room availability is unconfirmed. The £180 flight gift and £90-per-person tour contribution are the organisers’ figures. No rooms, flights or excursions have been booked through this page.</p></details><details><summary>Transport, March weather and accessibility</summary><p>Geneva hotel guests can receive a local transport card; it does not cover the Alps excursion or UK airport travel. March can mean snow, ice and cold at altitude. The alpine photographs show winter scenery suited to the season. March snow cover varies, especially on the valley floor; these are inspiration, not a forecast or photographs verified as taken in March. The full coach day is long, with walking at stops; step-free hotel rooms, coach access and any mobility requirements need checking directly before booking.</p><p>Geneva’s published tourist tax is CHF 4.25 per adult per night. It is already included in both observed hotel totals, so we do not charge it twice.</p></details><details><summary>Research, hotel links and photo credits</summary><ul class="sources"><li><a href={ibisLink(nights)}>ibis budget Genève Aéroport · current rates and room layout</a></li><li><a href="https://mgallery.accor.com/en/hotels/1322.html">Hotel Rotary MGallery · rooms, location and transport card</a></li><li><a href={accorLink(nights)}>Accor · check selected dates and current rates</a></li><li><a href="https://www.keytours.ch/lauterbrunnen-grindelwald-interlaken/">Keytours · departure calendar, route, inclusions and fares</a></li><li><a href="https://www.geneve.com/en/attractions/detail/excursion-from-geneva-interlaken-jungfraujoch">Geneva Tourism · the three-stop tour</a></li><li><a href="https://www.geneve.com/de/reiseplanung/ausfluege/geneva-transport-card-for-host">Geneva Tourism · transport card and tourist tax</a></li><li><a href="https://buvettedesbains.com/">Buvette des Bains · published menu</a></li><li><a href="https://www.jungfrau.ch/en-gb/food-drink/restaurant-eigergletscher/">Jungfrau Railways · Restaurant Eigergletscher</a></li></ul><p>Hotel photographs: Accor / the respective hotels. Winter panoramas: <a href="https://www.jungfrau.ch/en-gb/grindelwald/">Jungfrau Railways / Grindelwald</a> and <a href="https://www.jungfrau.ch/en-gb/lauterbrunnen/">Lauterbrunnen</a>. Lake Brienz: <a href="https://unsplash.com/photos/Q9QISW_Xu70">Rodrigo Curi / Unsplash</a>. Other destination photography via Unsplash: <a href="https://unsplash.com/photos/a-snow-covered-mountain-with-a-village-in-the-foreground-fQyUhZhDWCA">Zhu Yunxiao / Grindelwald</a>, <a href="https://unsplash.com/photos/green-mountains-and-houses-during-daytime-bvSLu1Lew3Y">Robin Ulrich / Lauterbrunnen</a>, <a href="https://unsplash.com/photos/a-tall-fountain-shoots-water-over-lake-geneva-xUjq36cpeE8">Arnaud Roch / Geneva</a>, <a href="https://unsplash.com/photos/red-flowers-near-body-of-water-during-daytime-ORS4Y-et7xg">Tucker Monticelli / Interlaken</a>.</p></details></section>
  <footer><p>Different beds. Same crew.</p><span>KATIE & ALEX · SWITZERLAND, MAYBE.</span><a href="/stendo">← The new plan</a></footer>
